  <section id="dining">
    <h2>Dining</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Boma – Flavors of Africa</strong> is the buffet, for breakfast and dinner. Disney listed breakfast 7:30 a.m. to 11:30 a.m. and dinner 5:00 p.m. to 9:30 p.m. when we checked. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
      <li><strong>Jiko – The Cooking Place</strong> is the table-service dinner restaurant, listed at 5:00 p.m. to 9:30 p.m. It's a Disney Signature Dining location, and Disney says it does not take same-day bookings. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
      <li><strong>The Mara</strong> is the quick-service restaurant, listed at 6:30 a.m. to 11:00 p.m. when we checked. <span class="verify">[verify hours still current]</span></li>
      <li><strong>Sanaa</strong> is table service at Kidani Village, a short walk from Jambo House.</li>
      <li>Both Uzima Springs Pool and Samawati Springs Pool have a lounge and bar for drinks and snacks.</li>
      <li>You can use mobile ordering in the My Disney Experience app at the quick-service spots.</li>
      <li><strong>Park dining reservations:</strong> Disney resort guests can book their whole stay (up to 10 nights) starting 60 days before arrival. Jiko and Boma book up, so plan ahead.</li>
    </ul>
